{"sourceUrl":"https://hgxy.sdut.edu.cn/2026/0618/c7745a566980/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:22.614626+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://hgxy.sdut.edu.cn/2026/0618/c7745a566980/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>为增进大学生对山东理工大学化学化工学院学科、科研与研究生培养等的了解，促进大学生互动交流，激发科研兴趣，选拔有潜质的优秀大学生继续深造，</span><span>山东理工大学</span><span>化学化工学院拟于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span><span>日举办</span><span>“</span></span><span>2026</span><span><span>年研究生招生夏令营</span><span>”。现将有关情况通知如下：</span></span></p><p><span>一、活动时间、地点</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span><span>日，山东理工大学</span><span>4号实验楼1</span></span><span>05</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>二、报名条件</span></p><p><span>山东省内外高校</span><span>2027 </span><span>届本科毕业生，不限专业，化学工程与工艺、应用化学、化学、制药工程等相关专业学生优先。</span><strong><span>（校外学生可凭借研究生报考信息报销差旅）</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>三、活动内容</span></p><p><span>山东理工大学及化学化工学院基本情况介绍、学科发展现况、研究生招生培养及奖助政策，各课题组负责人及骨干教师与学生互动交流，化学化工学院实验室参观。</span></p><p><span>四</span><span>、报名方式</span></p><p><span>1. </span><span>学生报名：通过填写在线文档或扫描二维码报名，截止</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日。</span></p><p><span>方式</span><span>1</span><span>：</span><span><span>【腾讯文档】化学化工学院</span><span>2026研究生招生夏令营活动报名表</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DU1pIQ0VsWk9XTENJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DU1pIQ0VsWk9XTENJ</span></span></a></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hgxy.sdut.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/63/05/273e7db242068ccd2a575f474553/fdacb4e7-d34a-431a-97d8-1259d7665d43.png\"/></p><p><span>方式</span><span>2</span><span>：</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>导师报名：请各位导师按照学院提供的模板制作宣传</span><span>PPT，以课题组为单位，于6月</span></span><span>25</span><span>日前发送至邮箱</span><span>3634494508@qq.com</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>宣讲：以</span><span>课题组为单位</span><span><span>，时间不超过</span><span>15分钟（含提问交流时间）</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>如需咨询，请联系学院</span><span>研究生</span><span>与科研工作</span><span>办公室</span><span>，地点：</span><span>13</span><span>号教学楼</span><span>446</span><span>室，联系人：庄老师，电话</span><span>0533-2781681</span></p><p><strong><span>活动日程安排详见下表：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8:15</span><span>-8:</span><span>3</span><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学生签到，地点：</span><span>4号实验楼1</span></span><span>05</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8:30</span><span>-8:</span><span>4</span><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span>开幕式</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8:45</span><span>-</span><span>9</span><span>:</span><span>1</span><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span>介绍学院招生情况及政策</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>9:1</span><span>5</span><span>-11:</span><span>3</span><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>课题组招生宣传：抽签顺序</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>11:30-13:00</span></p></td><td><p><span>三餐</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>14:00-17:00</span></p></td><td><p><span>参观</span><span>4</span><span>号实验楼、新型聚氨酯材料研究院、清洁化工技术研究院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>17:00</span></p></td><td><p><span>活动结束</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p><span>初审：王怡笑</span></p><p><span>复审：单琳耀</span></p><p><span>终审：牟海萍</span></p></div>","textSha256":"affbec6f92475b6577f6e718288c8a68f9f5c116762f3348f30a60796aefc1fb","textLength":770,"sourceSha256":"ed71c6e4703f95463a08632b25d5043c92bc8d653ee05937676af8289e291267","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a57752cbe50320870bd9","title":"2026年山东理工大学化学化工学院2026年研究生招生夏令营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:22.614626+00:00"}
